<section class="sg-sec" id="inspired"><h2>What it inspired</h2><ul class="sg-chain"><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Melody by Eliezer Mordecai Gerovitsch</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1897</span><span class="sg-chain-h">the most common tune, arranged from an older one</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Setting for the West London Synagogue (Simon W. Waley)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">musical setting</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Adon Olam (Uzi Hitman)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1976</span><span class="sg-chain-h">new tune for the 8th Hasidic Song Festival</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Prayers, Psalms and Hymns for the Use of Jewish Children</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1905</span><span class="sg-chain-h">loose English translation in the original metre</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">English version attributed to Frederick de Sola Mendes</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1906</span><span class="sg-chain-h">translation (The Jewish Encyclopedia; Union Hymnal, 1914)</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Koren Sacks Siddur</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2009</span><span class="sg-chain-h">English translation drawing on the 1905 version</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Mishkan HaNefesh</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">2015</span><span class="sg-chain-h">English translation echoing de Sola Mendes</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Setting by Salamone Rossi</span><span class="sg-chain-h">musical setting</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Adon Olom: Past-Present-Future (Samuel Schuman)</span> <span class="sg-chain-y">1944</span><span class="sg-chain-h">song about the prayer</span></li><li><span class="sg-chain-n">Cello variations on Adon Olam (Aaron Minsky)</span><span class="sg-chain-h">variations</span></li></ul></section>
<section class="sg-sec"><h2>People, places and events</h2><div class="tih-tags"><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Solomon ibn Gabirol</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Hai Gaon</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Yohanan ben Zakkai</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Abraham ibn Ezra</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">John Rayner</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Reuven Kimelman</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Morris Silverman</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Seligman Baer</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Eliezer Mordecai Gerovitsch</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Simon W. Waley</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Uzi Hitman</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Frederick de Sola Mendes</span><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">West London Synagogue</span><span class="tih-tag sg-tag-plain">Israel</span></div></section>
